  "share_dialog": {
    "dialogHtml": "<div id=\"naya-install-overlay\" class=\"naya-install-overlay show\" role=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"Install NayaNET as an app\" style=\"display: flex;\"><div class=\"naya-install-card\"><img class=\"naya-install-icon\" src=\"/icon-192.png\" alt=\"NayaNET\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"><div class=\"naya-install-title\">Install NayaNET</div><div class=\"naya-install-sub\">Your intelligent hub, on your home screen \u2014 one tap away, no login, ever. Any page can become an app: install it from here, from the sidebar, or from Settings.</div><button type=\"button\" class=\"primo theme-purple elev-2 naya-install-go\" id=\"naya-install-go\">Install the app</button><div class=\"naya-install-steps\" id=\"naya-install-steps\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"naya-install-row mine\"><div class=\"naya-install-plat\">Computer \u00b7 Chrome or Edge <span class=\"naya-install-you\">you</span></div><ol><li>Click the <b>install icon</b> at the right end of the address bar.</li><li>Click <b>\u201cInstall\u201d</b>.</li><li>NayaNET opens as its own app.</li></ol></div><div class=\"naya-install-row\"><div class=\"naya-install-plat\">iPhone \u00b7 iPad \u00b7 Safari</div><ol><li>Tap the <b>Share</b> icon \u2014 the square with an arrow \u2014 at the bottom of Safari.</li><li>Scroll the list and tap <b>\u201cAdd to Home Screen\u201d</b>.</li><li>Tap <b>\u201cAdd\u201d</b> \u2014 NayaNET is on your home screen.</li></ol></div><div class=\"naya-install-row\"><div class=\"naya-install-plat\">Android \u00b7 Chrome</div><ol><li>Tap the <b>three-dot menu</b> at the top right.</li><li>Tap <b>\u201cInstall app\u201d</b> (on some phones: \u201cAdd to Home screen\u201d).</li><li>Tap <b>\u201cInstall\u201d</b> \u2014 you\u2019re done.</li></ol></div><div class=\"naya-install-row\"><div class=\"naya-install-plat\">Mac \u00b7 Safari</div><ol><li>In the menu bar, click <b>File</b>.</li><li>Choose <b>\u201cAdd to Dock\u201d</b>.</li><li>NayaNET lands in your Dock.</li></ol></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"naya-install-later\" id=\"naya-install-later\">Not now</button></div></div>",
